    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your cargo cult of amphibians is on its final leg of existence, as their water supply has mysteriously gone dry; they only have one month before starvation. Using your jetpack made by hand, you must climb to the top of their industrial cosmos to convene with your god to restore water to the village.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Will you save them?</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Pressure Based Climbing</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2386200/extras/9da8270fcd150fda961f48f1d424efa2.poster.avif?t=1754266221\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2386200/extras/9da8270fcd150fda961f48f1d424efa2.webm?t=1754266221\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2386200/extras/9da8270fcd150fda961f48f1d424efa2.mp4?t=1754266221\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You don't use the keyboard to move in this game. The mouse, and your eyes, determine your path, and thus, <strong>your success.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2386200/extras/a69970798b54a221795821295db4ce6c.poster.avif?t=1754266221\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2386200/extras/a69970798b54a221795821295db4ce6c.webm?t=1754266221\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2386200/extras/a69970798b54a221795821295db4ce6c.mp4?t=1754266221\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Sell Scraps, Buy Upgrades</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2386200/extras/a22ac0f82d2f0e565823fe08eb2c949b.poster.avif?t=1754266221\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2386200/extras/a22ac0f82d2f0e565823fe08eb2c949b.webm?t=1754266221\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2386200/extras/a22ac0f82d2f0e565823fe08eb2c949b.mp4?t=1754266221\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3D Platforming</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jetpack Boost Mechanic</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic World Based Crosshair</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Diegetic UI</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Non-Linear Level Design</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p></li></ul>",
